Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: python/libxml.c
Line: 2269
Function: libxml_doc
Bug type: null-pointer-dereference
CWE: CWE-476
Explanation: cur is obtained via PyxmlNode_Get(obj) and used immediately (cur->type) without a NULL check. Passing an invalid object causing PyxmlNode_Get to return NULL leads to a NULL pointer dereference.

Source context:
```c
